{"pageid":3490,"title":"Version 1.39.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.39.0</span>","revid":15638,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.39.0\">Version 1.39.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Coil\" title=\"Speed Coil\">Speed Coil</a>! (Currently forced in stud shop)</li>\n<li>New permissions UI</li>\n<li>Added more meteor locations</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Temporarily disabled auto-trust for friends, due to security concerns</li>\n<li>More ore spawns per vein</li>\n<li>Increased amount of rocks in certain regions</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a> is now far easier to find!</li>\n<li>Various meteor locations are now easier to reach</li>\n<li>Buffed <a href=\"/wiki/Willow\" title=\"Willow\">Willow</a></li>\n<li>Buffed <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Axe\" title=\"Living Axe\">Living Axe</a></li>\n<li>Buffed <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma Trees</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed mobile having the option to play vertical</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.39.1\">Version 1.39.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_2\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">grabby grabber</a> getting stuck when filling in <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a></li>\n<li>Fixed xbox not being able to select the trust/block buttons</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.39.2\">Version 1.39.2</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_3\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed stats on <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Axe\" title=\"Living Axe\">Living Axe</a> showing the wrong numbers</li>\n<li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a> and Clay not spawning</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.39.3\">Version 1.39.3</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_4\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a> again</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.39.4\">Version 1.39.4</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 22nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Removed ocean meteor crash site</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_5\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed Dragging error from lack of PrimaryPart</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.39.5\">Version 1.39.5</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 22nd, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:_2\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>(Mysterious Monday) - Added \"<a href=\"/wiki/Intersection_Conveyor\" title=\"Intersection Conveyor\">In.. Co..</a>\" and \"<a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fu.. Co..</a>\"</li>\n<li>Directional signs placed around the map</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:_2\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Spherical Objects (<a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bomb</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Large_Bomb\" title=\"Large Bomb\">Large Bomb</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor Core</a>) now have flat sides</li>\n<li>\"Explosive Needed\" signs redesigned</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_6\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Mike's Mine Vinyl Rock now works (missing primary part)</li>\n<li>Blocking no longer extends into the caves</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNe